1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Open Settings → Language. Choose English, မြန်မာ or 简体中文.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Open Mouse setup. Allow Accessibility and Input Monitoring in macOS System Settings, then return and Refresh.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:25,000
In Identify buttons, start capture. Press one wheel or side button inside the box. Select its position and confirm.

4
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:34,167
This sample mouse uses 3 = wheel, 4 = lower side, 5 = upper side. Your mouse may report different numbers.

5
00:00:34,167 --> 00:00:43,167
Keep your existing settings, or choose a starter setup. Only the listed inputs change; Undo can restore them.

6
00:00:43,167 --> 00:00:50,167
Return to Buttons. Select a numbered label to edit its action. Enable GlideMouse when ready.
